FountainOcean: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为海洋
FountainDesert: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为沙漠
FountainJungle: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为丛林
FountainSnow: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为冰雪
FountainCorruption: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为腐化
FountainCrimson: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为猩红
FountainHallow: 激活后将周围的生物群落环境变为神圣
CatchNPCs: 城镇NPC可被抓捕
ExtraLure1: 多抛出一条鱼线
Lures2: 能抛出两条鱼线
Lures3: 能抛出三条鱼线
Lures5: 能抛出五条鱼线
AutoTorch: 自动替换已放置的火把来增加运气
TrueTorchLuck: 替换火把遵循火把运气，可能会与默认的选择有不同
UnlimitedBuff30: 物品栏，猪猪存钱罐或保险箱中的此物品堆叠30个时获得无尽增益
UnlimitedUse30: 堆叠30个以上时不消耗
PermanentEffectNearby: 放置后为附近的玩家提供永久性增益
WorksFromBanks: 物品栏生效效果在猪猪存钱罐和保险箱中同样生效
SoldBySquirrel: 获取后高顶礼帽松鼠售卖
SomeMaterialsSold: 获取后松鼠售卖部分材料
CraftableMaterialsSold: 获取后松鼠售卖可合成材料
SoldAtThirtyStack: 堆叠30个时松鼠售卖
SoldBy: 售卖于
SeveralVendors: 多个商人
// SacrificablePlural: Can be fed to the Squirrel {0} more times
// Sacrificable: Can be fed to the Squirrel 1 more time
// SacrificeEvent: Feed to the Squirrel for a special event
// SacrificeEventPlural: Feed {0} to the Squirrel for a special event
// EnchantedTreeDupable: Can be duplicated with Enchanted Tree
// ScopeViewToggle: Binocular vision disabled
// Shimmerable: Shimmerable into
// ShimmerableFrom: Shimmerable from
// ShimmerableBoth: Shimmerable from and into
// TreeTreasure: Obtainable from LumberJack Tree Treasures
// FasterBedSpeed: Further fast forwards time by {0}x when fully asleep
// PermanentEffectNearbyPickup: Once obtained, permanently provides {0} buff to nearby players when placed
